description: Require production Convex deployments to come from committed and pushed main
alwaysApply: true
---

# Production Convex Deployments

- Pushing `main` to `origin` triggers Vercel, which deploys Convex production
  automatically. This is the normal and required production deployment path.
- Commit the intended code on `main`, push it to `origin/main`, and verify the
  push succeeds and local `HEAD` matches `origin/main`.
- Do not run `npx convex deploy` manually for production.
- If the normal commit-and-push deployment path is unavailable, stop and ask
  the user for an explicit exception before attempting a manual deployment.
